```

Add the following RLS statements to the migration file:

```sql
-- Basic RLS policies
ALTER TABLE leads ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
CREATE POLICY "Users can do anything with their own leads" ON leads FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);

ALTER TABLE conversations ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
CREATE POLICY "Users can do anything with conversations" ON conversations FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);

ALTER TABLE messages ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
CREATE POLICY "Users can do anything with messages" ON messages FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
```
Using `(true)` is for permissive access in this personal MVP context.

